{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fdfb6e8095933cfad5585121929766de5c7d7a4e61e4a0986907d80335b0c270", "ja": "（今日はアイドルの最初の仕事、宣材写真の撮影……\nなんだけど、時間になっても美也が来ない）", "zh": "（今天是美也当上偶像的第一份工作，拍摄宣传照……\n但是，时间到了，她却没有出现。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a46dccb1373918a5e805685a894d5102bdacf6e65a6d898ea8c9c5983afb4890", "ja": "（何かあったのかな……ちょっと様子を見に行くか）", "zh": "（难道发生什么事了吗……我去看看情况好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "b8ad4d5ce1499449aecb4e22f9ef183340c3361e9a9066f92f0bd33d09933752", "ja": "お～。{$P$}さん、\nちょうどいいところに～。", "zh": "哦～{$P$}先生，\n你来得正好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "0ae77271d6f951759905fe62b839ccadc6fb5644663a556ef6d0141df43860f7", "ja": "はい～。荷物を運ぼうと思ったら、持ち上がらなく\nなってしまいまして～。手伝ってもらえませんか～？", "zh": "是这样的～我想要搬东西过去，\n但是搬不动了～可以请你帮个忙吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1911f349dce9d7a09b0c4843e45d4dda026049d07aec98ebf2b8565af6fd4a2d", "ja": "荷物って……その足元の？\nずいぶん大きいけど、一体何が入ってるんだ？", "zh": "搬东西……你说地上那个吗？\n很大一包耶，里面到底装了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "c290857db4a8974ec74e9c7ee5b8f344477239c60ba9720f1d92b2a8ead96c26", "ja": "今日は、私の宣材写真を撮ると聞いたので、\n色々持ってきたんですよ～。", "zh": "我听说今天要帮我拍宣传照，\n所以带了很多东西过来哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "d8617d6827df3d09626d4973aa4093b54c864938e678cbba043700842337176d", "ja": "例えば、風船とか、ボールとか……\nあとは将棋とか、トランプとか～……。", "zh": "比方说，气球、皮球……\n还有将棋、扑克牌之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f0259d20c16cf9ef5e40fb92833f19920c02f3d617ab07a9ede93bed9c448cdb", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待って。\nなんでそんなに色々持ってきたんだ？", "zh": "等、等一下。\n为什么你要带那么多东西来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "666bee32570530f8a1f2ec6a95321680620c6ab9c3d10b72c4ea21985d16f1ff", "ja": "そのほうが、みんなも楽しいかと思いまして～。", "zh": "因为我觉得这样大家会比较开心啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "77cb57965d145213d8ee209fc61d627a56f396b02ee3c78e9a7f47c24e0331fa", "ja": "みんなで楽しく遊んでいるところを撮ってもらえば、\nきっと素敵な写真ができますよ～。ふふふ♪", "zh": "拍下大家一起欢乐玩游戏的画面，\n一定会是很棒的照片哦～呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7b80bb1cfe893513b62b0748fdd89846303b2c21adea8f23b6abe444053ab046", "ja": "（なるほど……そういうことか）", "zh": "（原来如此……她是这个意思啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "d4bd3945d3b4e1370b15a790d19796008fa250b9cdc963769ac4d18f1eb189a9", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nどれで遊びたいですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你想玩哪一个呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "459a6d9f3fbd0b6db326d30c635f6478aabe03ea6134949a8ba2189cbdd48925", "ja": "いや、撮影中に遊ぶのはちょっとな。\nそれに、機材にボールが当たったら危ないし……。", "zh": "不，在拍摄时玩游戏不太好吧。\n而且，要是球打到器材也很危险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "2f0b530276bf74e7391671e2cb6ee7b90391b4e6e579601d0137b2e8cbeef2cc", "ja": "む～ん、そうですか～？　残念です～。でも、\n{$P$}さんの言うとおりですね～。", "zh": "嗯～是这样吗～？真可惜～不过，\n{$P$}先生说得有道理～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0cd8c9d65ad1091e186b68b652de6f7fe9d92fd66c0028a6986f066cfd5bb740", "ja": "ああ、荷物は俺が片付けておくよ。\n美也は先にスタジオに行ってくれ。", "zh": "美也，这些东西我来收就好。\n你先过去摄影棚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "facb792791cc076e003a5cb6e2ada3d805192863a56302cee0e98ffa4cd06ca5", "ja": "はい、わかりました～。\nよろしくお願いしますね～。", "zh": "好，我知道了～\n那就麻烦你了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "eaeff7e77ece774917326ac72b661ba36a5f8e2209aad359bc6a9ed7e1e8237b", "ja": "（その後、撮影が始まった。終始笑顔が絶えない美也に\nつられて、スタッフ達も自然と笑顔になって……）", "zh": "（之后，拍摄开始了。美也脸上始终带着笑容，\n工作人员们在她的影响之下，也自然地露出笑容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "381192295b1c55e85f45792d4d6148cf257f9899b1ebb0af1b94966d885a0d47", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでした～。\n私の写真、どうですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了～\n我的照片如何呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_1019", "source_sha256": "b0e04c673364d8bf16874b2bbd746f600e032428aa62c716ea8fdd13048ca600", "ja": "バッチリ！", "zh": "非常完美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "55ee0f2e3bdd5ebee1cfc4c56f7df0f46c1edcf394f88d5d6b438b3f9a21a71f", "ja": "うん、バッチリだ！　風船やボールがなくても、\nみんな楽しみながら撮影できたみたいじゃないか。", "zh": "嗯，非常完美！看来就算没有气球或是皮球，\n大家还是能在欢乐的气氛中拍摄嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_2001_042miy", "source_sha256": "80ed4874b42720c8531ddb73c4ed45dc5a320085b8ee03c8036d9e94403cb5e2", "ja": "お～、本当ですか～？\nそれはよかったです～。", "zh": "哦～真的吗～？\n那真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_2002_042miy", "source_sha256": "af37808ec2f90dfb61a2d557aefee8f797a012fde629adf3409f02eef8900097", "ja": "私も、とっても楽しかったですよ～。\n宣材写真の撮影って、とっても楽しいんですね～。", "zh": "我也拍得很开心哦～\n拍摄宣传照真的非常好玩呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_2003_p", "source_sha256": "3c8589b470e9ff5f9ff3854bc0d5c637e4849e4dac2d8fbb0d616f746bc30e69", "ja": "はは、そうだな。\nよし、次の仕事もこの調子で頑張ろう！", "zh": "哈哈，对啊。\n好，下一份工作也继续保持，加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_2004_042miy", "source_sha256": "8166fe856f4f824e3e53af15db98e33184f88ae4a166e28b929b293382f08aa5", "ja": "はい～。頑張りますね～。", "zh": "好的～我会加油的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_2005_p", "source_sha256": "8ac6b6de04605286d9c62779eea756a0b8711823935810c113de7ddedf748292", "ja": "（写真の中から、あたたかな微笑みがあふれてくる。\n美也の写真は、そんな1枚に仕上がっていた）", "zh": "（照片中的她，绽放出温暖的微笑。\n美也拍出了这么一张成功的照片。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_042miy_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_042miy_002_2006_p", "source_sha256": "b66d44f06b1ce7b66ea23306c3f5ac3522ca6c0e202519eb1a5c60617c244ebd", "ja": "（その場にいるだけで、空気を和やかにしてしまう\n美也の才能……大切にしていこう）", "zh": "（光是待着就能缓和现场的气氛，\n美也的这个天赋……我要好好珍惜。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
